{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐感受细腻度明显不如X，尤其缺少X中具体音型、力度变化、旋律回归及情绪转折的层层展开。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分工让故事叙述保持连续，右侧感受又能快速扫读，尤其S08、S10、S11、S12这些短时段，观众更容易及时抓住人物正在经历什么。Y对人物为什么舍不得、为什么不愿回头、最后如何重新决定生活，交代得比较自然完整。X的【】突出重点很有效，音乐感受也明显更细腻、更具体，尤其是标注到时出现的内容能让观众跟着音乐经历情绪变化；但部分短时段的感受信息过于密集，实际观看时容易顾着读词而错过音乐。综合普通观众边听边看的体验，我更倾向Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7d7552a0-dc15-4dbf-872f-6c44aac15859", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T231146131349Z", "elapsed_seconds": 67.594, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:12:53.738674+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "350652e1b4cf5d31856837dda36acd85504e6369712abb29914157758c0ac368", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f6